text But even after the lights go out, I still can't get to sleep...
text I keep thinking.
text About the old man and Sanae-san.
text They each had their own dreams.
text The old man had theater, and Sanae-san had teaching.
text They both shut themselves off from those aspirations.
text Entrusting Nagisa with them instead.
text That's how they made the decision to watch as their daughter experienced her own joy in life.
text That's right...
text ──"In the end, the reason for living might be found among your 'family and loved ones.'"
text That's the conclusion they came to.
text I'm the same way.
text My reason for living is to be with Nagisa and be happy together.
text I'm here, on this earth, so that I can do that.
text And...
text Nagisa, carrying a new life inside of her, feels the same.
text Our dreams, our joy... She's always held onto them.
text And here I am, trying to make her give up on those things...
text Can I really take that away from her...?
text If I lost Nagisa, I'd be left hopeless.
text And I'm trying to do the same thing to her...
text I can't do that...
text Not me...
text But I feel worried...
text That place...
text Nothing stays the same forever, just like what I saw happen to all that greenery...
text Isn't she going to disappear in the exact same way...?
text Is she too just going to drift off to some far away place?
text Isn't that how all of this is going to go...?
text ......
text ...No.
text That doesn't have anything to do with this...
text I don't believe in that kind of thing...
text After all, Nagisa and I made it this far...
text We've been able to overcome all the challenges we've been faced with...
text Thanks to our connection.
text That's why...
text ...we should be able to overcome this too.
text After all, she's saying that she's going to do her best...
text Nagisa, a person with that much strength...
text Which is why...
text We need to keep on doing what we've always done...
text Face forward and keep walking...
text Combine our strength...
text In order to keep making our dreams come true.
